      "value": "I completely agree, there should be a button to reset your avatar to default so you can unstuck your self if you ended up uncapable of accessing the menu normally. \nEspecially since the key shortcut does not work well for everyone, wether it's because of a different keyboard layout or other reasons (crashing directly after world load due to the avatar making it nearly impossible to execute it in time.)\n\nAdditionally i'd also implement a reset home button while at it.",
